  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.3\n      - Improve thread handling for ParticleEmitter\n      - Various fixes for PropertyList controls\n      - Add MaximizedWindowFrame property to FlatWindow\n      - Fix bugs in TabControl, spinner controls, PropertyList\n      \n      Version 2.0.2\n      - Add ContentContextMenu control\n      - Add CsvLineHelper helper class\n      - Add premade AeroTheme\n      - Fix ColorsHelper functions and add new functions\n\n      Version 2.0.1\n      - Fix broken ParticleEmitter control\n      - Improvements/fixes to PropertyList control and editors\n      - Fix small issues with SplitButton, KeyRegistry, ThemedWindow\n\n      See website for more details!",
